hrough ever-changing floors, fighting skeletons, zombies, dragons and other creatures. The soundtrack was composed by Danny Baranowsky, and players can load songs from their own MP3 collection to set the rhythm.\n\nFifteen playable characters offer different play styles, and the game works with a keyboard, a controller or a USB dance pad. Local co-op supports a second player, and mod support is included. It suits fans of roguelikes and rhythm games who enjoy tight, pattern-based challenge."}}